### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = 

### ===== SYSTEM ENDPOINTS ===== ###

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ===== AUTHENTICATION ===== ###

### Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### Login (Copy the token from response and paste in @token variable above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=securepass123

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== TRANSACTIONS ===== ###

### Create Buy Transaction - AAPL
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_symbol": "AAPL",
  "stock_name": "Apple Inc.",
  "transaction_type": "buy",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price_per_share": 150.50,
  "notes": "First Apple purchase"
}

### Create Buy Transaction - GOOGL
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_symbol": "GOOGL",
  "stock_name": "Alphabet Inc.",
  "transaction_type": "buy",
  "quantity": 5,
  "price_per_share": 2800.00,
  "notes": "Google investment"
}

### Create Buy Transaction - MSFT
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_symbol": "MSFT",
  "stock_name": "Microsoft Corporation",
  "transaction_type": "buy",
  "quantity": 15,
  "price_per_share": 380.00,
  "notes": "Microsoft shares"
}

### Create Sell Transaction - Partial AAPL
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_symbol": "AAPL",
  "transaction_type": "sell",
  "quantity": 3,
  "price_per_share": 160.00,
  "notes": "Partial sell for profit"
}

### Get All Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get All Transactions with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Transactions for Specific Stock (AAPL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/stock/AAPL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Specific Transaction (Replace 1 with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Transaction (Replace 1 with actual ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== PORTFOLIO ===== ###

### Get Portfolio Summary (All Stocks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Stock Summary (AAPL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio/summary/AAPL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Stock Summary (GOOGL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio/summary/GOOGL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Total Portfolio Value
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio/total
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ERROR TESTING ===== ###

### Try to Sell Without Owning Stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_symbol": "TSLA",
  "transaction_type": "sell",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price_per_share": 250.00
}

### Try to Access Protected Route Without Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/

### Try to Login with Wrong Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=wrongpassword
